WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.300
-Finally,
it is Wednesday night,

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.467
and you know what that means.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:05.767
It's "Tonight Show"
Audience Trivia Night!

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:09.567
-♪ "Tonight Show"
Audience Trivia Night ♪

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:13.100
♪♪

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.167
-Now, I'm going to ask
random people

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:16.834
in the audience
a trivia question,

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:18.934
and if you answer correctly,
you win a prize.

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:21.467
Who wants to play?
Anyone want to play?

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:22.868
No one on this side
wants to play?

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:25.100
Over here. Come here.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.467
Oh, yeah. Hi, here you go.

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.367
Ready for --
What is your name?

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:29.534
-Ella.
-Ella, where are you from?

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.667
-California.
-Hey. Welcome, Ella!

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.767
[ Applause ]

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.901
Alright, here's the question.

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:42.400
-Seconds.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.234
Milliseconds.

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:45.868
-Judges?
[ Buzzer ]

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:47.000
Ooh, I'm sorry, the answer was,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.601
"Trump's encounter
with Stormy Daniels."

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:49.834
Sorry. Thank you so much.

00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:52.234
Thank you for playing.
Who else wants to play?

00:00:52.234 --> 00:00:54.701
You right there, buddy?
Hey, here you go. Here you go.

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:55.868
What's your name
and where are you from?

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:59.601
-Michael From Texas.
-Michael from Texas!

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.067
-C'mon, Texas!

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:03.868
-Texas, alright.
Here's the question.

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.234
-I don't know.

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:12.033
The one down?

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:13.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.501
-The one down. Judges?

00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:15.601
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:16.801
I'm sorry, it was Ozempic.

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.767
Ozempic. Thank you so much.

00:01:18.767 --> 00:01:19.767
How about, who else?

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:22.000
Anyone over here?
Yes. Hey, bud.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
How you doing? That's for you.
That's a great shirt.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.534
-Thank you.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:27.634
-What is your name?
Where are you from?

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:29.100
-Cory from Detroit, Michigan.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.734
-Yeah, Detroit!

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:32.634
[ Applause ]

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:36.033
Alright, here we go.

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:41.901
-Frostbite?

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.234
-Judges?
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:46.767
No, skiing with Gwyneth Paltrow.
Thank you so much.

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:49.067
Thank you. I appreciate that.
Let's go around here.

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.567
I'll go around.
I'll go around this side.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:52.234
There you go.

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:53.434
Hey, how are you guys doing?

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:55.667
Doing good. Looking good.
Good-looking audience.

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:58.634
Hey, bud! Get up. Get up!

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:00.868
What's your name?
-Loic.

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:02.167
-Louie?
-Loic. French.

00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:03.868
French name.
-Loic?

00:02:03.868 --> 00:02:05.033
-Yeah.
-Wow.

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:06.601
Loic from France.

00:02:06.601 --> 00:02:08.300
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.434
Here you go. You hold that.

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:11.267
I'll give you the question here.
Ready, Loic?

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:24.968
-The government. Yeah?

00:02:24.968 --> 00:02:26.734
-Government?
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:26.734 --> 00:02:29.167
TikTok. Thank you so much.
I appreciate it.

00:02:29.167 --> 00:02:32.467
Thank you for being here.
We have time for one more.

00:02:32.467 --> 00:02:34.133
Right there. Come on.

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:36.067
Nice to see you.
-Hi.

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:37.300
-What is your name
and where are you from?

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.868
-Victoria Ybarra from
California.

00:02:38.868 --> 00:02:42.200
-Yeah, Victoria from California!

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.667
Alright, the question is...

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:51.534
-A bar keeper?

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:52.701
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:52.701 --> 00:02:55.100
-We were looking
for "Spirit Airlines pilot."

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.734
Sorry. Thank you
so much for being here.

00:02:56.734 --> 00:02:58.767
Unfortunately, no one took home
the prize tonight.

00:02:58.767 --> 00:02:59.968
We'll try again next week

00:02:59.968 --> 00:03:01.300
on "Tonight Show"
Audience Trivia Night.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.567
Stick around!

00:03:02.567 --> 00:03:05.067
We'll be right back
with Matt Damon, everybody!

00:03:05.067 --> 00:03:06.300
Come on back!

